beta2.official [a013481b0] , v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8] , v4.2.1.stable.official [b09f793f5]\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta3 - Ubuntu 24.04.1 LTS 24.04 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 Ti (nvidia; 535.183.01) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-12100F (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAccording to the documentation the settings parameter `internationalization/locale/test`\n\n> If non-empty, this locale will be used when running the project from the editor.\n\nFrom this follows that when running the exported project this setting will be ignored. But that is not what happens. The game will be using the locale set on `test`\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the MRP\n- If your system is using the \"zh\" locale: go to the `internationalization/locale/test` setting and change it to \"es\"\n- Export the game\n- Run the exported game\n- It should show the locale of your system, but will show the locale set in `internationalization/locale/test`\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[localizationbug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18726061/localizationbug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu